# Companies

Curated entity notes for organisations Nick is actively engaged with — employers (current/prospective), consulting clients, his own companies, key external partners. One file per organisation, kebab-case slug.

**Frontmatter contract:**
```yaml
title: Organisation name
type: company | organisation | nonprofit | govt
domain: career | consulting | surf-lifesaving | accessbuddy | ...
status: active | prospective | dormant | declined | deprioritised
created: YYYY-MM-DD
updated: YYYY-MM-DD
related:
  - "[[note-slug]]"
```

**What belongs here:**
- Live employers and prospective employers in the career pivot
- Consulting clients and prospects
- Nick's own entities (Nicholas Wood Digital Consulting)
- Surf-lifesaving orgs Nick has formal roles or contracts with (LSV, SLSA, SMLSC)
- Significant external partners on his SaaS products

**What doesn't:** vendors of tooling, generic mentions, companies with no live thread.

**Update cadence:** on status change (application submitted → interview → outcome), on material development (funding, leadership change affecting Nick's contact, contract milestone), or quarterly review.
